# Build context filter for `edge/Dockerfile` (context: the repository root).
#
# The root `.dockerignore` excludes `template/`, which is exactly where the H5
# build output lives. BuildKit prefers this per-Dockerfile file, so the edge
# build gets its own view of the context without touching a root dotfile that
# belongs to the orchestrator and to the legacy PHP image.
#
# Everything is excluded, then the two things the edge needs are allowed back.

*
!next/docker/edge
!template/uni-app/dist

# Never, whatever the rules above say.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
